# Each test program runs a number of test cases, reading its input files
# relative to the srcdir environment variable. The results are reported in
# the TAP format and a test case that is skipped (for example, because the
# amount of physical memory cannot be determined) is not a failure. So we
# extract the failed test cases and expect there to be none.
#
: test-cases
:
env "srcdir=$src_base" -- $* | sed -n -e 's/^((not ok|Bail out!).*)$/\1/p'
